# What must never enter a container build.
#
# The API image is built from the repository root, so without this file the
# build would try to package the whole folder — including a 444 MB LINCS
# signature table, 1.7 GB of DepMap CSVs and 5.5 GB of raw TCGA. None of that is
# needed at runtime: the app serves pre-computed JSON payloads.

# Version control and local tooling
.git
.gitignore
**/.venv
**/.venv_copilot
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ipynb_checkpoints
**/.DS_Store
.cursor

# Raw inputs — used only by the offline pipeline, never by the running app
v3/data/raw
v3/data/interim
v3/artifacts
depmap_data
LINCS_DPDs_archive
omnipathr-log
siginfo_beta.txt
compoundinfo_beta.txt
geneinfo_beta.txt
9606.protein.*.txt.gz
*.gctx
.RDataTmp
.Rhistory

# Derived artifacts that are regenerated, plus the 6.3 GB symlinked matrix
outputs/copilot_artifacts/compact_gctx
outputs/mofa
outputs/nbs
results

# Node and Next build output
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/coverage
**/dist

# Notebooks and figures
**/*.ipynb
v3/reports/figures
